    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d163">

                <pb facs="0330" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg242"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72116/603: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Agent at Corfu</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dodge</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Corfu</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-14T18:00:00+02:00"
                            >November 14, 1918—6 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 15—11:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Foreign Office circular note states that Servian Government has decided to create
                    international commission to investigate violations of the Hague Conventions in
                    view of the great number violations by <pb facs="0331" n="243" xml:id="pg243"/>
                    Bulgarians, Austrians and Germans and requests the Government of the United
                    States to appoint a member of the commission. Servian Government trusts the
                    Government of the United States will accede to this request which is especially
                    urgent.</p>
                <p>Another circular note incloses three official documents enumerating violations
                    international law especially by Bulgarians. The atrocities described are
                    appalling. Copies by next mail.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d163-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
